main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ remaining arguments deduced: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
